{"lesson":{"id":"completion_carre_sommet","title":"Compléter le carré et lire le sommet","language":"fr","learning_goal":"Transformer x² + 6x − 7 en forme canonique et lire le sommet de la parabole."},"math_context":{"symbols":{},"expressions":{}}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_modele","introduces":[{"id":"carre","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[0,0],[3,0],[3,3],[0,3]]},"style":{"role":"accent"}},{"id":"bande","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[3,0],[5,0],[5,3],[3,3]]}},{"id":"l_x","type":"label","content":"x","attachment":{"parent":"carre","anchor":"bottom"}},{"id":"l_xh","type":"label","content":"x","attachment":{"parent":"carre","anchor":"left"}},{"id":"l_trois","type":"label","content":"3","attachment":{"parent":"bande","anchor":"bottom"}},{"id":"l_aire","type":"label","content":"x²","layout":{"center_on":"carre"}},{"id":"l_sixx","type":"label","content":"6x","layout":{"center_on":"bande"}},{"id":"eq","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x","layout":{"next_to":"carre","direction":"down","gap":"lg"}}],"beats":[{"id":"debut","say":"Pour comprendre la complétion du carré, dessinons x au carré plus six x.","cues":[{"id":"c_dessin","text":"dessinons"}],"do":[{"id":"d_carre","verb":"draw","target":"carre","at":"cue:c_dessin"},{"id":"d_bande","verb":"draw","target":"bande","at":"cue:c_dessin"},{"id":"s_cotes","verb":"show","target":"l_x","at":"after:d_carre"},{"id":"s_xh","verb":"show","target":"l_xh","at":"after:d_carre"},{"id":"s_trois","verb":"show","target":"l_trois","at":"after:d_bande"}]},{"id":"aires","say":"Le carré a une aire de x au carré. La bande mesure trois de haut sur deux x de large, alors elle a une aire de six x.","cues":[{"id":"c_aire_carre","text":"aire de x au carré"},{"id":"c_aire_bande","text":"aire de six x"}],"do":[{"id":"s_aire","verb":"show","target":"l_aire","at":"cue:c_aire_carre"},{"id":"s_sixx","verb":"show","target":"l_sixx","at":"cue:c_aire_bande"}]},{"id":"coupe","say":"Coupons cette bande en deux bandes de trois x chacune, et posons-en une sous le carré.","cues":[{"id":"c_coupons","text":"Coupons"}],"do":[{"id":"w_eq","verb":"write","target":"eq","at":"cue:c_coupons"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_coin","introduces":[{"id":"piege","type":"callout","content":"on ajoute et on retire le même 9"}],"beats":[{"id":"manque","say":"Il manque un petit coin en bas à droite : un carré de trois sur trois, donc un neuf.","cues":[{"id":"c_coin","text":"petit coin"},{"id":"c_neuf","text":"un neuf"}],"do":[{"id":"s_piege","verb":"show","target":"piege","at":"cue:c_coin"}]},{"id":"idee","say":"On va donc ajouter ce neuf pour compléter le carré, puis le retirer aussitôt pour ne rien changer à l'expression.","cues":[{"id":"c_ajouter","text":"ajouter ce neuf"},{"id":"c_retirer","text":"le retirer"}],"do":[{"id":"h_eq","verb":"highlight","target":"eq","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_ajouter","end":"cue_end:c_retirer"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_algebre","introduces":[{"id":"etape1","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x = (x + 3)^2 - 9"},{"id":"etape2","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x - 7 = (x + 3)^2 - 9 - 7"},{"id":"etape3","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x - 7 = (x + 3)^2 - 16","parts":[{"id":"debut","text":"x^2 + 6x - 7"},{"id":"milieu","text":"= (x + 3)^2 - 16"}]},{"id":"formule","type":"math","content":"f(x) = a(x - h)^2 + k","parts":[{"id":"ah","text":"a(x - h)^2"},{"id":"k","text":"+ k"}]}],"beats":[{"id":"pas1","say":"En algèbre : x au carré plus six x, c'est x plus trois, le tout au carré, moins neuf.","cues":[{"id":"c_algebre","text":"En algèbre"},{"id":"c_moins_neuf","text":"moins neuf"}],"do":[{"id":"d_piege","verb":"dim","target":"piege","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"f_carre","verb":"fade_out","target":"carre","at":"cue:c_algebre"},{"id":"f_bande","verb":"fade_out","target":"bande","at":"cue:c_algebre"},{"id":"f_eq","verb":"fade_out","target":"eq","at":"cue:c_algebre"},{"id":"w_e1","verb":"write","target":"etape1","at":"cue:c_moins_neuf"}]},{"id":"pas2","say":"Notre expression complète avait aussi un moins sept. Alors on traîne ce moins sept avec nous.","cues":[{"id":"c_moins_sept","text":"moins sept"}],"do":[{"id":"t_e2","verb":"transform","source":"etape1","target":"etape2","at":"cue:c_moins_sept"}]},{"id":"pas3","say":"Moins neuf moins sept, ça donne moins seize. On peut maintenant écrire la forme canonique.","cues":[{"id":"c_seize","text":"moins seize"},{"id":"c_canonique","text":"forme canonique"}],"do":[{"id":"t_e3","verb":"transform","source":"etape2","target":"etape3","at":"cue:c_seize"},{"id":"w_formule","verb":"write","target":"formule","at":"cue:c_canonique"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_sommet","introduces":[{"id":"axes","type":"axes","params":{"x":[-6,4],"y":[-20,6]}},{"id":"parabole","type":"function_graph","params":{"expression":"(x+3)^2 - 16","domain":[-7,1]},"style":{"role":"accent"}},{"id":"axe_sym","type":"line","params":{"from":[-3,-20],"to":[-3,6]},"style":{"role":"secondary"}},{"id":"p_sommet","type":"point","params":{"at":[-3,-16]},"style":{"role":"result"}},{"id":"l_sommet","type":"label","content":"S(-3 ; -16)","attachment":{"parent":"p_sommet","anchor":"right"}},{"id":"lecture","type":"math","content":"h = -3, \\; k = -16","parts":[{"id":"h","text":"h = -3"},{"id":"k","text":"k = -16"}],"layout":{"next_to":"formule","direction":"down","gap":"md"}}],"beats":[{"id":"trace","say":"Traçons cette parabole pour voir ce que la forme canonique nous donne.","cues":[{"id":"c_trace","text":"Traçons"}],"do":[{"id":"d_axes","verb":"show","target":"axes","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"d_para","verb":"draw","target":"parabole","start":"cue:c_trace","end":"cue_end:c_trace"}]},{"id":"lis","say":"Dans a fois x moins h au carré plus k, le h et le k sont les coordonnées du sommet. Ici, h égale moins trois et k égale moins seize.","cues":[{"id":"c_h","text":"le h et le k"},{"id":"c_ici","text":"Ici"}],"do":[{"id":"h_ah","verb":"highlight","target":"formule","part":"ah","role":"given","start":"cue:c_h","end":"cue_end:c_h"},{"id":"h_k","verb":"highlight","target":"formule","part":"k","role":"given","start":"cue:c_k","end":"cue_end:c_k"},{"id":"w_lecture","verb":"write","target":"lecture","at":"cue:c_ici"}]},{"id":"pointe","say":"Le sommet est donc le point moins trois, moins seize. Il se trouve sur la verticale x égale moins trois.","cues":[{"id":"c_point","text":"moins trois, moins seize"},{"id":"c_vert","text":"x égale moins trois"}],"do":[{"id":"d_axe","verb":"draw","target":"axe_sym","start":"cue:c_vert","end":"cue_end:c_vert"},{"id":"s_p","verb":"show","target":"p_sommet","at":"cue:c_point"},{"id":"s_lp","verb":"show","target":"l_sommet","at":"after:s_p"}],"pause_after":"long"}]}}
